Simple Icons
------------

PortBar bundles 70 brand glyphs in PortBar/Assets.xcassets/TechIcons, each a
single-path 24x24 SVG taken unmodified from the Simple Icons project.

    Source:  https://simpleicons.org
    Repo:    https://github.com/simple-icons/simple-icons
    License: CC0 1.0 Universal (public domain dedication)
             https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

The CC0 dedication covers the SVG artwork only. It does not grant any rights in
the trademarks the artwork depicts.

